spainciv is a port to Spain of usaciv by Andrej Karpathy (https://karpathy.ai/usaciv/), released under the MIT
licence (see LICENSE). spainciv's own changes are released under the same MIT licence. The original source is kept
unchanged at the tag `upstream-2026-11-26`; the country configurations, the Spanish data sources and the
changes listed in UPSTREAM.md are on top of it.

Data sources keep their own licences; the in-app Almanac lists each one with its files, URLs and checksums.

The social card is lettered in Cinzel (pipeline/core/fonts/Cinzel.ttf), Copyright 2020 The Cinzel Project Authors,
under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (pipeline/core/fonts/OFL.txt).
